name: Higher Education Act (HEdA)
description: SR 414.20 — Federal Act of 30 September 2011 on Funding and Coordination of the Swiss Higher Education Sector (Higher Education Act, HEdA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 June 2025. No legal force.
